# Python Runtime Skills - Windows PowerShell vs WSL/Linux

```yaml
header:
  id: SKILL://brain.python-runtime.ps
  intent: EXECUTION_GUIDE
```

## PowerShell (Windows)

```powershell
# Run Python scripts
py script.py
python script.py
python3 script.py

# Common commands
py -m pip install package
py -c "print('hello')"
```

## WSL/Linux

```bash
# Run Python scripts
python3 script.py
python script.py

# Common commands
python3 -m pip install package
python3 -c "print('hello')"
```

## Cross-platform Script Wrapper

```powershell
# .know/scripts/run.ps1
param($Script, $Args)
$cmd = "py $Script $Args"
Invoke-Expression $cmd
```

